      "role": "user",
      "content": "just finished a 14 hour shift in the er. honestly i dont even know why i bother anymore. just more of the same... people coming in broken and me just patching them up enough to send them back out to the same mess. it feels like trying to bail out the ocean with a spoon. it's just endless.",
